<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:38,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Zabuza Disperses</font>

32
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:38,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Into the Snow...</font>

33
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gato, why did you come here?</font>

34
00:01:44,290 --> 00:01:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And who are those henchmen?</font>

35
00:01:49,170 --> 00:01:51,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our strategy has changed
a little...</font>

36
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry about this Zabuza,</font>

37
00:01:55,010 --> 00:01:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you will die here.</font>

38
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

39
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since hiring a regular Shinobi
costs a lot of money,</font>

40
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hired Rogue Ninja like you.</font>

41
00:02:08,390 --> 00:02:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, it would have been even
more ideal</font>

42
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:12,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to save my money and effort if
Shinobi-to-Shinobi battles</font>

43
00:02:12,650 --> 00:02:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ended in each killing the other off.</font>

44
00:02:15,070 --> 00:02:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you are certainly not worthy
of being called</font>

45
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Demon of the
Hidden Mist Village.</font>

46
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you were to ask me,
you're just a cute little demon!</font>

47
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are those guys?</font>

48
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:29,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So many of them...</font>

49
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi... I apologize.</font>

50
00:02:33,670 --> 00:02:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our fight ends here...</font>

51
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as my reason to
take down Tazuna is gone,</font>

52
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is no reason to fight you either.</font>

53
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... you are right.</font>

54
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That reminds me...</font>

55
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I owe him something.</font>

56
00:02:55,570 --> 00:03:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He squeezed my arm 'til it broke...</font>

57
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, he's dead.</font>

58
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You bastard!</font>

59
00:03:08,790 --> 00:03:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing, hey?!</font>

60
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Don't act so recklessly...!</font>

61
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say something, too!
He was your comrade, right?</font>

62
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:21,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, punk.
Haku is already dead.</font>

63
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

64
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you feel anything watching
him doing that!</font>

65
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you with Haku for a long time!</font>

66
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As Gato used me...
I was simply using Haku.</font>

67
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I'd told you...</font>

68
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We Shinobi are merely tools.</font>

69
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I wanted were his skills
and not Haku himself.</font>

70
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no regrets...</font>

71
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you...
Do you really mean that?</font>

72
00:03:58,170 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, stop.</font>

73
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to fight
him anymore... Besides...</font>

74
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!
My enemy is still... this one!</font>

75
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He...</font>

76
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He really liked you!</font>

77
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there someone special in your life?</font>

78
00:04:20,690 --> 00:04:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He liked you that much!</font>

79
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a person feels he wants
to protect a person special to him,</font>

80
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that person can truly become strong.</font>

81
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so,
don't you feel anything at all?!</font>

82
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's difficult for me to completely
become a Shinobi.</font>

83
00:04:40,460 --> 00:04:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really... honestly...</font>

84
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't feel anything at all?</font>

85
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to make that person's
dream come true...</font>

86
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For that, I could completely
become a Shinobi.</font>

87
00:04:53,890 --> 00:04:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a person becomes
as strong as you...</font>

88
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does that person really
behave like you?</font>

89
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He threw his life away
for you!</font>

90
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to make that
person's dream come true...</font>

91
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is my dream.</font>

92
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:16,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't even fulfill his
own dreams and yet...</font>

93
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was happy.</font>

94
00:05:20,290 --> 00:05:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To die as a tool...!</font>

95
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...
That's... too painful...</font>

96
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:37,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kid...</font>

97
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say anything... anymore.</font>

98
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:03,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku was...</font>

99
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wasn't just thinking of me.</font>

100
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was feeling pain inside
for you</font>

101
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while he battled you guys too...</font>

102
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.
He was too kind...</font>

103
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm glad we could fight with you
at the end.</font>

104
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

105
00:06:29,610 --> 00:06:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, little punk,
it's as you say, after all...</font>

106
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi are human too...</font>

107
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe it's impossible to become
an emotionless tool...</font>

108
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:47,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've lost.</font>

109
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kid! Give me the Kunai knife!</font>

110
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

111
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

112
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough! Take them down!</font>

113
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

114
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you crazy?</font>

115
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think you can win by yourself
against this many of us?</font>

116
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Demon!</font>

117
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're so anxious
to join your friend...</font>

118
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you go ahead... alone!</font>

119
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately...</font>

120
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't... intend on going...
to the same place... as Haku!</font>

121
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:34,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?! Pretending to be so tough...</font>

122
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to hell with me!</font>

123
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no big deal...</font>

124
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the Demon of
the Hidden Mists Village</font>

125
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">dies and goes to hell,
he can become a real demon.</font>

126
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look forward to it!</font>

127
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll let you find out
for sure</font>

128
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I'm a cute little demon or not in hell!</font>

129
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku...</font>

130
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:04,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... it's goodbye, Haku...</font>

131
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for everything...</font>

132
00:10:10,290 --> 00:10:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

133
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look away.</font>

134
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the end for
a man who lived fiercely.</font>

135
00:10:31,690 --> 00:10:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup...</font>

136
00:10:36,650 --> 00:10:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I... die...?</font>

137
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

138
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

139
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I... am I...?!</font>

140
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, you're heavy.</font>

141
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

142
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

143
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, Sasuke-kun, Sasuke-kun...!</font>

144
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...
That hurts...</font>

145
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things turned out well,
didn't they, Sakura?</font>

146
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, you shouldn't move...!</font>

147
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, where's Naruto?</font>

148
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also,
what happened to that mask guy?</font>

149
00:11:23,070 --> 00:11:24,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's fine.</font>

150
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... the masked kid,
he died...</font>

151
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Died? Did Naruto get him?</font>

152
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'm not really sure,
but he protected Zabuza...</font>

153
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:43,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had faith in you.</font>

154
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are awesome, Sasuke-kun!</font>

155
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You avoided getting inflicted with
any mortal wounds!</font>

156
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the beginning... he intended to...</font>

157
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

158
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

159
00:11:56,070 --> 00:11:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun's all right!
He's alive!</font>

160
00:11:59,570 --> 00:12:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

161
00:12:12,330 --> 00:12:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was feeling pain inside
for you while he battled you guys too...</font>

162
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:20,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was too kind...</font>

163
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... He...</font>

164
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Sasuke's all right too...</font>

165
00:12:27,930 --> 00:12:29,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a relief...</font>

166
00:12:30,850 --> 00:12:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, hey!</font>

167
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are too relaxed!</font>

168
00:12:35,650 --> 00:12:39,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn Ninja...!
Killing our source of money!</font>

169
00:12:40,110 --> 00:12:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this,</font>

170
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no choice but to attack
the whole town and</font>

171
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take everything valuable!</font>

172
00:12:47,570 --> 00:12:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot, this isn't good!</font>

173
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:49,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Kakashi-sensei!</font>

174
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:52,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you have a Jutsu
to annihilate them all at once?</font>

175
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible!
I've used too much Chakra!</font>

176
00:12:56,170 --> 00:12:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

177
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enemies who come any closer
to the island...</font>

178
00:13:10,470 --> 00:13:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With all the might of
all the island's people...</font>

179
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will not be allowed to live!</font>

180
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

181
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari!</font>

182
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heroes always arrive
on the scene late!</font>

183
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari... You guys...</font>

184
00:13:31,830 --> 00:13:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'm gonna help out, too!</font>

185
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

186
00:13:41,630 --> 00:13:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can do that even
with my scarce Chakra...</font>

187
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least, it will bluff...</font>

188
00:13:47,010 --> 00:13:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

189
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi Version!</font>

190
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... are you ready to fight?!</font>

191
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, we're not!</font>

192
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've done it!</font>

193
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sounds like it's over.</font>

194
00:14:31,470 --> 00:14:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

195
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...
I need to ask you a favor.</font>

196
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:38,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

197
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His...
I want to see his face...</font>

198
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

199
00:15:16,010 --> 00:15:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

200
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:19,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Snow...</font>

201
00:15:19,890 --> 00:15:21,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Snow at this time
of the year...?</font>

202
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku...
Are you crying?</font>

203
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Kakashi...</font>

204
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were always at my side...</font>

205
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the very least...</font>

206
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can be at your side in the end.</font>

207
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's possible...</font>

208
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:22,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to go...</font>

209
00:16:24,790 --> 00:16:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the same place...</font>

210
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as you.</font>

211
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

212
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was born in a village
where it snowed a lot.</font>

213
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:01,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

214
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:05,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was a boy as pure as snow...</font>

215
00:17:07,670 --> 00:17:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd be able to go, Zabuza.</font>

216
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:15,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two of you... together.</font>

217
00:17:18,970 --> 00:17:21,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you know, Kakashi-sensei...</font>

218
00:17:21,770 --> 00:17:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

219
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if the way a Ninja
should be</font>

220
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is really as these
two were saying.</font>

221
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi should not seek
the reason for their own existence.</font>

222
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's important is to
exist merely as tools.</font>

223
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the same in the Land of Leaves.</font>

224
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's what
it really means</font>

225
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to become a real Ninja.</font>

226
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess... I guess...!</font>

227
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like that!</font>

228
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think so, too?</font>

229
00:17:56,930 --> 00:17:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

230
00:17:58,470 --> 00:18:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... That's why all Ninja live</font>

231
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">trying to figure that
out without realizing...</font>

232
00:18:07,890 --> 00:18:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like Zabuza... and that kid...</font>

233
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

234
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

235
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've just decided!</font>

236
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to pursue my
own Ninja Way!</font>

237
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna sprint straight
ahead and pursue</font>

238
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a way that I absolutely
won't regret!</font>

239
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to you the bridge
was safely completed,</font>

240
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we will miss you very much.</font>

241
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care.</font>

242
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for everything.</font>

243
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, now!</font>

244
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll come back for
a visit again, Tazuna!</font>

245
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For sure...?</font>

246
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

247
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari... you're gonna
miss us, aren't you?</font>

248
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right to cry.
Go ahead and cry!</font>

249
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't cry!</font>

250
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right if you cry,
Naruto nii-chan!</font>

251
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, is that so?</font>

252
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya!</font>

253
00:19:28,890 --> 00:19:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh....!</font>

254
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are so stubborn.</font>

255
00:19:39,530 --> 00:19:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy changed Inari's mind...</font>

256
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Inari changed the minds
of the village people.</font>

257
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy created a bridge
linking us to hope,</font>

258
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a bridge called courage.</font>

259
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So a linking bridge...</font>

260
00:19:57,170 --> 00:19:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speaking of bridges,</font>

261
00:19:58,300 --> 00:20:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we need to name
this bridge, don't we?</font>

262
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true.</font>

263
00:20:01,930 --> 00:20:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case,</font>

264
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a perfect name
for this bridge.</font>

265
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, what is it?</font>

266
00:20:09,220 --> 00:20:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Naruto Great Bridge?
How's that?</font>

267
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a good name.</font>

268
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I'll get back soon
and have Iruka-sensei treat me</font>

269
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to ramen as
the mission completion celebration!</font>

270
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And! And! I'll tell Konohamaru
tales of my heroic exploits!</font>

271
00:20:27,910 --> 00:20:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I...</font>

272
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sasuke-kun, do you want to go
on a date</font>

273
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when we get back to the village?</font>

274
00:20:34,170 --> 00:20:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I don't think so.</font>

275
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like that...?!</font>

276
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know! You know!
I'll go with you!</font>

277
00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet!</font>

278
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! Naruto!</font>

279
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Are you sure
that name's okay?</font>

280
00:20:49,890 --> 00:20:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This name is to wish that
this bridge will never collapse...</font>

281
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And someday, it'll be the name
of a very famous bridge...</font>

282
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A name heard around the world.</font>

283
00:21:05,610 --> 00:21:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's truly what I hope.</font>

284
00:21:33,490 --> 00:21:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

285
00:21:36,870 --> 00:21:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:40,330 --> 00:21:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:53,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

289
00:21:53,930 --> 00:21:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

290
00:21:57,270 --> 00:22:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

291
00:22:00,730 --> 00:22:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

292
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:07,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

293
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

294
00:22:10,860 --> 00:22:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:22:14,450 --> 00:22:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

296
00:22:27,420 --> 00:22:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:22:30,760 --> 00:22:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:22:34,140 --> 00:22:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:22:37,470 --> 00:22:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

300
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:44,560
